    {
      "id": 14,
      "code": "G",
      "title": "going to",
      "rule": "*Be going to* — kelajakdagi reja, niyat: *am/is/are going to* + feʼl. *I am going to visit Samarkand.* — Men Samarqandga bormoqchiman. *She is going to cook dinner.* — U kechki ovqat pishirmoqchi. Inkor: *We aren't going to watch TV.* — Biz televizor koʻrmoqchi emasmiz. Savol: *Are you going to study? — Yes, I am.* *Is he going to play? — No, he isn't.* *Tomorrow, next week, at the weekend* soʻzlari bilan keladi.",
      "examples": [
        "I am going to visit Samarkand.",
