        "en": "It is Friday evening. The family is talking about the weekend. Dilnoza is going to visit Malika in Tashkent. Bekzod is going to play football with his friends. Karim is going to work on the farm. Nodira isn't going to work. She is going to cook a big dinner. Tom isn't going to do anything. He is going to sleep!"
